。全球超过一半的工业机器人，也已经实现“中国制造”。'}, {'id': '20260824V0CR7R00', 'articletype': '4', 'title': 'FSD入华梦碎，中国被移出可使用地区，距官宣入华仅三个月', 'pic_style': 4, 'publish_time': '2026-08-24 22:28:17', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OdDY2uPzOnPVm2HwthFBuC4AWXuF47vlSQy8_VFAPMJj4AA_870492_compress/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/Oe1hugYT84z4w4wZUjvMsn7PlFKfMz2Loj-k02Qg_4QcgAA_294195_compress/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/Ot9yjeCynSRt-ne1_rorEMxWPhSnmSEVeKqzo_R-yVOzsAA_150120/0'], 'ext': {'640x360': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OE61HD4TftCwBNpfDBoEJbi4JkB5_91t6rM7a-tgBgnKAAA_640360/0', '196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OE61HD4TftCwBNpfDBoEJbi4JkB5_91t6rM7a-tgBgnKAAA_196130/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OE61HD4TftCwBNpfDBoEJbi4JkB5_91t6rM7a-tgBgnKAAA_330330/0', '480x640': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OE61HD4TftCwBNpfDBoEJbi4JkB5_91t6rM7a-tgBgnKAAA_480640/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OUBOlvCLrccCzo3JbYMJPGntFg0TaYmPbVz__vj3QFtw8AA_240240/0', 'aspect': '0.56', 'pic_first': 'https://puui.qpic.cn/vpic_cover/r1284mg4qxf/r1284mg4qxf_first.jpg/720'}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824V0CR7R00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260824V0CR7R00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824V0CR7R00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824V0CR7R00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '21927366', 'chl_name': '超电实验室', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14930550976_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14930550976_200200/0', 'mrk': '推动中国汽车行业向前发展，让汽车和未来触手可及。', 'last_art_update': '0', 'uin': 'ec35dc6c4751a8b4e678beb012698c36d6', 'encoded_suid': '8QMc23ZU7Iwcvjfe', 'vip_type': '30011', 'vip_type_new': '30011', 'vip_desc': '科技领域创作者', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876048581/0', 'medal_info': {'type_id': 26, 'medal_id': 40, 'medal_level': 1, 'medal_name': '万众瞩目', 'medal_desc': '腾讯新闻粉丝数达到1w', 'night_url': 'http://inew