5日，2026美网女单资格赛首轮，郑钦文以6-3、6-2击败同胞尤晓迪，晋级资格赛第二轮，也终结了近期的单打三连败。接下来，郑钦文将对阵法国球员布蕾尔。赢球了，当然高兴。打完最后一分，郑钦文露出了“久违的笑容”。但因为对手是中国同胞，郑钦文在赛后首先恭喜了尤晓迪，“真没想到第一轮就碰中国同胞”，然后郑钦文说：“也恭喜我自己，取得第一场胜利”。毕竟，郑钦文已经经历了三连败，其中就有一场是资格赛。三喜是：里巴教练也完全从车祸后的伤情中痊愈，重返团队。', 'declares': [{'type': 'self_declare', 'text': '作者声明：个人观点，仅供参考', 'self_declare_id': 2}]}, {'id': '20260823V0B0W200', 'articletype': '4', 'title': '22岁陆佳豪在篮球赛中倒地离世，半个多小时后急救车才到现场，家人接受18.8万元赔偿方案', 'pic_style': 4, 'publish_time': '2026-08-23 21:14:58', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OQdQP0E_rdzbBaK2JmwH7CSIR8_zujpuksbdaWyLu25kwAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OQdQP0E_rdzbBaK2JmwH7CSIR8_zujpuksbdaWyLu25kwAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OsUlNq2AeYyYV2reF4MxiVIxATRcrVoOn65EtfikZW0QoAA_150120/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'640x360': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OQdQP0E_rdzbBaK2JmwH7CSIR8_zujpuksbdaWyLu25kwAA_640360/0', '196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OQdQP0E_rdzbBaK2JmwH7CSIR8_zujpuksbdaWyLu25kwAA_196130/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OQdQP0E_rdzbBaK2JmwH7CSIR8_zujpuksbdaWyLu25kwAA_330330/0', '480x640': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OQdQP0E_rdzbBaK2JmwH7CSIR8_zujpuksbdaWyLu25kwAA_480640/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OQytQMK7_ioZSbEmYHD2Cdw29so55DGIrvFlR6sAY7LdEAA_240240/0', 'aspect': '0.56', 'pic_first': 'https://puui.qpic.cn/vpic_cover/q1284z3gmen/q1284z3gmen_first.jpg/720'}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260823V0B0W200', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260823V0B0W200', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260823V0B0W200', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260823V0B0W200'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '5118008', 'chl_name': '都市快报橙柿互动', 'icon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OTNkIYBZUjZiUK-yJKq9bM3v7jkHHOVzMNfXEs-zqx2SwAA_200200/0', 'sicon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OTNkIYBZUjZiUK-yJKq9bM3v7jkHHOVzMNfXEs-zqx2SwAA_200200/0', 'mrk': '都市快报由杭州日报报业集团主办。据最近全国晚报都市报竞争力排名，都市快报全