月末，齐鲁银行、南京银行、成都银行、浙商银行、光大银行、邮储银行、苏农银行、常熟银行等多家银行，均已对外披露增持实施进展。进入8月，随着银行板块股价创新高，增持与股价上涨形成正向循环。股东和管理层用真金白银为银行股投票，释放出看...'}, 'long_summary': '2026年以来，A股上市银行迎来股东与管理层密集增持的热潮。据公开信息，截至6月末，齐鲁银行、南京银行、成都银行、浙商银行、光大银行、邮储银行、苏农银行、常熟银行等多家银行，均已对外披露增持实施进展。进入8月，随着银行板块股价创新高，增持与股价上涨形成正向循环。股东和管理层用真金白银为银行股投票，释放出看好银行长期价值的明确信号。2026年的银行增持潮，呈现出范围广、主体多、节奏密的特点。从增持主体看，至少包含三类：股东、董事高管、以及银行自身。从节奏看，增持并非一次性动作，而是持续实施。'}, {'id': '20260824V083NN00', 'articletype': '4', 'title': '黄金价格上涨的原因未来可持续吗', 'pic_style': 4, 'publish_time': '2026-08-24 15:45:05', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/ODwREb1MZDjpXmcPBLvZgg_u1Fj_03YxbBiCm9mpZs-6EAA_870492_compress/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OKTwJDpOSfXmhtQDW6Aas6r6HzPQSep9Vq-7Imh7TDMnkAA_294195_compress/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OaggddexsrF17WwWh2f68xOmm0FUB6jqcjk6ibo9xgMUUAA_150120/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'640x360': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OuqjmuhGhzC8ZGMlK5WcIUnFXs5zYNivUfQh9VX4M85a4AA_640360/0', '196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OuqjmuhGhzC8ZGMlK5WcIUnFXs5zYNivUfQh9VX4M85a4AA_196130/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OuqjmuhGhzC8ZGMlK5WcIUnFXs5zYNivUfQh9VX4M85a4AA_330330/0', '480x640': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OuqjmuhGhzC8ZGMlK5WcIUnFXs5zYNivUfQh9VX4M85a4AA_480640/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/Oz-KRYW3VYFQ89RkviN630PULH5qmNhgyKj9e1yoYtVGgAA_240240/0', 'aspect': '0.56', 'pic_first': 'https://puui.qpic.cn/vpic_cover/k1284y4xpzs/k1284y4xpzs_first.jpg/720'}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824V083NN00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260824V083NN00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824V083NN00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260824V083NN00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '24097777', 'chl_name': '紫荆财富圈', 'icon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O1rwRoIs2fgpSQK67d_3mQwVL3feutGm6hmokyAQHZZFUAA/0', 'sicon': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O1rwRoIs2fgpSQK67d_3mQwVL3feutGm6hmokyAQHZZFUAA/